{"id":"n75998-1-9","stage":4,"title":"조퇴 · 早退","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75998-1-9-1","ko":"웬일로 집에 일찍 왔어요?","zh":"怎么这么早就回家了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"웬일로","meaning":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","explanation":"웬일：什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"웬일","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69528","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어요?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9641672a10627d98","term":"웬일","zh":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3","entryId":"69528","definition":"怎么回事；或指什么样的事。","pronunciation":["웬ː닐"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2b7eba5e8eb2ec1f147e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75998-1-9-2","ko":"배가 아파서 조퇴 신청을 하고 왔어.","zh":"因为肚子疼，所以我申请提前下班回来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조퇴","meaning":"早退","explanation":"조퇴：早退","readings":[{"term":"조퇴","audio":"/audio/2b8d68131b8058f7a1ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75998","senseId":"1","lemma":"조퇴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신청을","meaning":"申请","explanation":"신청：申请；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신청","audio":"/audio/0793bce18be02a79f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65346","senseId":"1","lemma":"신청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"2b8d68131b8058f7","term":"조퇴","zh":"早退","audio":"/audio/2b8d68131b8058f7a1ad.mp3","entryId":"75998","definition":"在学校或工作单位等里，未到规定时间而提早离开。","pronunciation":["조ː퇴","조ː퉤"]},{"id":"0793bce18be02a79","term":"신청","zh":"申请","audio":"/audio/0793bce18be02a79f122.mp3","entryId":"65346","definition":"向团体或机关等正式要求办理某事。","pronunciation":["신청"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c07f5e198cbf000747a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75998","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为肚子疼，所以我申请提前下班回来了。","怎么这么早就回家了？","敏俊怎么每次考试都能得满分啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么这么早就回家了？","敏俊怎么每次考试都能得满分啊？","因为肚子疼，所以我申请提前下班回来了。"],"answer":2}]}
